Wrote 4 units to units/
warning: web.container: depends_on db used condition: service_healthy, which systemd ordering cannot express; see the comment in the generated unit
note: web.container: compose used `restart: unless-stopped`, which systemd cannot express exactly. Restart=always is the closest: systemd honours an explicit `systemctl stop` for as long as the machine stays up, and starts the unit again at boot because of the [Install] section.

